{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09892","headline":"九日使君席奉饯卫中丞赴长水 · 岑参","name":"九日使君席奉饯卫中丞赴长水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"节使横行西出师，鸣弓擐甲羽林儿。\n台上霜风凌草木，军中杀气傍旌旗。\n预知汉将宣威日，正是胡尘欲灭时。\n爲报使君多泛菊，更将弦管醉东篱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}